## Asset Provenance
All 3D assets in Flatlands (buildings, trains, railway tracks, nature foliage, street furniture, and autonomous entities) are procedurally constructed at runtime using Three.js `BufferGeometry` primitives (`class B` procedural mesh builder). No third-party proprietary 3D mesh files (.gltf, .fbx, .obj) or external bitmap textures were incorporated. Procedural sound effects are synthesized dynamically using the Web Audio API (`AudioContext` oscillator and noise envelopes).
